Project Name

QGuard Helix Revenue Intelligence Dashboard™

Objective

Design and implement a production-ready Enterprise Revenue Intelligence Platform that serves as the centralized financial, subscription, billing, customer, and business analytics dashboard for the entire QGuard Helix ecosystem.

The dashboard must consolidate revenue, subscriptions, billing, payment providers, forecasting, customer analytics, and financial KPIs into one modern enterprise interface.

This application should eliminate the need to open Stripe, PayPal, Google Play Console, RevenueCat, or other dashboards separately.

